 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Jump the gun.",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 2.65
  },
  {
   "text": "No, please! By all means.",
   "start": 2.65,
   "end": 5.3
  },
  {
   "text": "So he's been there and done that for a long time, and uh.",
   "start": 12.1,
   "end": 15.15
  },
  {
   "text": "So nice to have him MC as well, and warm welcome to Lydia, general manager of the AI.",
   "start": 15.15,
   "end": 19.9
  },
  {
   "text": "Yeah, you know we're so happy to open the show for you and.",
   "start": 19.9,
   "end": 27
  },
  {
   "text": "Hi to everyone watching along online.",
   "start": 27,
   "end": 30.25
  },
  {
   "text": "AIE code is.",
   "start": 27,
   "end": 30.25
  },
  {
   "text": "Kind of our vertical, very focused, smaller format.",
   "start": 30.25,
   "end": 34.2
  },
  {
   "text": "Uh, you know, format on on coding agents, and I think it's been such a huge year in coding agents.",
   "start": 34.2,
   "end": 40.4
  },
  {
   "text": "There's also been a lot of.",
   "start": 40.4,
   "end": 42.95
  },
  {
   "text": "Different evolutions in terms of like how we think about what the mission of coding is.",
   "start": 42.95,
   "end": 48.3
  },
  {
   "text": "We used to have.",
   "start": 42.95,
   "end": 48.3
  },
  {
   "text": "You know, and specific track titles like coding agents and software factories and all these things, but now I'm talking about like system one thinking and.",
   "start": 48.3,
   "end": 55.25
  },
  {
   "text": "And raising your ambition and all these like very fancy higher level abstractions of work, so.",
   "start": 55.25,
   "end": 61.25
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm excited to see for you to see, and I'm excited to me personally to attend all these talks that are coming along.",
   "start": 61.25,
   "end": 68.65
  },
  {
   "text": "And I'm just going to talk a little about 2026 with AIE.",
   "start": 68.65,
   "end": 74.95
  },
  {
   "text": "So we've had a really big year this year.",
   "start": 68.65,
   "end": 74.95
  },
  {
   "text": "We had our first event in London.",
   "start": 74.95,
   "end": 80.25
  },
  {
   "text": "We also graduated up into Moscone for our World's Fair.",
